            "review_title": "Review at Beach House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "HyungJoon C\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent services\nMay 2025 • Family\nExcellent services, good food, nice views and everything and prefer to visit again with family together again!!!\nThanks\nWritten May 1, 2025\nDanang Marriott Non Nuoc Beach Villas\nDear our valued guest,\n\nThank you so much for your kind review! We’re thrilled to hear that you and your family had a great experience at our restaurant. It’s wonderful to know you enjoyed the seafood, tomahawk, and the panoramic view of Non Nuoc Beach.\nWe can’t wait to welcome you back for another memorable dining experience. Your feedback means the world to us, and we’re looking forward to hosting you and your family again soon!\n\nWarm regards,\nDanang Marriott Non Nuoc Beach Villas\nRead more\nWritten October 7, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
