            "review_title": "Review at Beach House Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Michael H\nSacramento, California2 contributions\n0\nAmazing hospitality and great food with a stunning view !\nMar 2025 • Family\nWe ate here after a very long day flying in .The hospitality here is amazing . Special thanks to Thao , Ly , Xuan they made us special and treated us with amazing Service , the food here is wonderful , we specially liked the Sizzle and Sea promotion . The chef and Ly even made my special order of scallops happen even if it is not included in the menu . Thao recommendation on the dessert was great . But most of all above anything else the hospitality of Thao , Ly and Xuan was the highlight of our evening . Thank you very much.\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2025\nDanang Marriott Non Nuoc Beach Villas\nDear Mikeavh, \n\nThank you so much for your glowing 5-star review! We are thrilled to hear that you enjoyed your stay and meals with us. Your kind words about our rooms and restaurant service truly mean a lot.\n\nWe strive to provide each guest with a memorable experience, and it’s wonderful to know that we succeeded during your visit. We look forward to welcoming you back to Danang Marriott Non Nuoc Beach Villas in the near future.\n\nWarm regards,\nDanang Marriott Non Nuoc Beach Villas\nRead more\nWritten April 8, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
